CDPA-LLMs — Open-source reference implementation

This repository contains the technical implementation of the CDPA-LLMs
decision-preference assessment platform. Application materials, slide decks,
formal research question banks, participant-derived reference data, private
deployment records, credentials, and generated assessment results are not part
of this distribution.

The included CSV files are synthetic examples created solely to demonstrate
the data contract and execution pipeline. They are not validated instruments
and must not be represented as the original research banks.

Model and provider names are compatibility examples and do not imply
affiliation, endorsement, or continuing API availability.
